--- !u!114 &5758228176192100431
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 4976806853408612784}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 25af376044baca1488e0dd588efe48d0, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SoloBigDialogue
  mainText: {fileID: 1064707185611743288}
  nameText: {fileID: 4649970021668359451}
  lines:
  - With that, I left the undergound cave and returned to the beach proper.
  - Despite my anger, I'd say I had a good time in the cave. It was quite a new experience
    for me.
  - Sure, it wasn't exactly pleasant, and being lied to all the time isn't good,
    but I managed to survive, so that's cool.
  - The prize I got ended up being alright. Not a bad amount, but not enough to justify
    what I went through.
  - The company running the thing ended up shutting down. I guess I got through to
    Big Jay and he convinced the higher ups to quit it.
  - Good for him, although I still don't exactly trust him. He can work on his self
    improvement without me.
  - Now then, I wonder what beach I should visit next!
  textSpeed: 0.01
  emotionChanges: 00000000010000000700000003000000000000000000000001000000
